### What the chapters of "The Staff Room" share: the game's own messages
### about the CUPS commands it doesn't simulate. Commands, options, paths
### and outputs are not translated.

cups-classes-not-simulated = lpadmin: printer classes (-c, -r) are not simulated in this game.
cups-cupsd-run = cupsd: the scheduler runs as a service here: use systemctl (start, stop, restart, status cups). cupsd -t tests the configuration.
